This tar file contains the latest version of lua along with a few useful libraries that are needed for the
Lmod command.

Make sure that your has the ncurses library and ncurses development packages installed.  



The usual install method will install lua:

 $ CC=gcc ./configure --prefix=/PATH/TO/LUA


where obviously you must replace /PATH/TO/LUA with something useful on your system such as "/usr/local"

If you wish to have link with static libraries you can do:

 $ CC=gcc ./configure --prefix=/PATH/TO/LUA --with-static=yes


Then:

 $ make
 $ make install


The add the path to lua into your PATH environment variable.
